WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:05,210
Is this okay?

2
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:10,210
All three are moongrass, enough to last you a whole day

3
00:00:10,210 --> 00:00:14,845
he is pregnant

4
00:00:14,845 --> 00:00:19,480
How many are there?

5
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:23,640
There should only be one. It's been a few months and he's probably going to give birth.

6
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:27,900
Disciple Master Chu has not yet asked for the teacher’s sister’s name.

7
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,860
It turns out you are Master Chu

8
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:36,490
My name is Duanmu Dai, and Elder Dan’s adopted son is my master.

9
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:38,490
Master has roughly told you about your situation.

10
00:00:38,490 --> 00:00:41,490
You want to break through your talent and go to the county, right?

11
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,580
Yes, senior sister, what can you do?

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:49,210
Come with me, I'll help you practice

13
00:00:49,210 --> 00:00:52,780
Senior sister, what is the meaning of this physical training?

14
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,780
It’s been more than half a month since you entered the imperial garden

15
00:00:54,780 --> 00:00:57,980
You should have heard some rumors about Master at some point.

16
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:01,980
Do you think Lord Ling forcibly broke through Xiantian County and entered the end?

17
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:03,980
Will it be something easy?
